# Project Overview

This is a multi-tenant SaaS product.

Stack:

Backend:
- NestJS, TypeScript strict mode
- MySQL, Prisma ORM
- JWT auth (access token in-memory, refresh token in httpOnly cookie)
- RBAC with permission-based guards
- Global user model + tenant membership (one user, multiple tenants)

Frontend:
- Next.js App Router, TypeScript strict mode
- Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui components
- React Hook Form + Zod for forms
- TanStack Query for server state
- Zustand for client state
- next-intl for i18n (English + Arabic, RTL support)

User levels:
1. Super Admin — platform owner, manages tenants and global settings
2. Tenant Admin — manages their own workspace (users, roles, settings)
3. Tenant User — regular member with role-based access

Key rules:
- Every tenant-owned API query must include tenantId
- Never trust frontend permissions — backend enforces RBAC
- Read cursor-pitfalls.md before touching auth, API client, CSP, env, storage, or Prisma
